---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy - SVG Clean Kit"
  description="SVG Clean Kit's privacy commitment. 100% client-side SVG optimization with zero server uploads, zero tracking, and zero telemetry."
>
  <Header />

  <main class="py-14 sm:py-20 bg-[var(--color-canvas)]">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6">
      
      <!-- Page Header -->
      <div class="border-b border-[var(--color-hairline)] pb-8">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <span class="inline-block h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-[var(--color-mute)]">
            Privacy First
          </span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="font-sans text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-1.5px] text-[var(--color-ink)] sm:text-4xl">
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-xs text-[var(--color-mute)]">
          Last updated: October 2026 • Effective immediately
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Content Sections in Geist Hairline Container -->
      <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-body)]">
        
        <section class="rounded-[12px] border border-[var(--color-hairline)] bg-[var(--color-canvas-elevated)] p-6 sm:p-8">
          <h2 class="font-sans text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]">
            1. Our Core Principle: Zero Server Transmission
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            At <strong>SVG Clean Kit</strong> (<a href="https://svgcleankit.pages.dev" class="text-[var(--color-link)] underline">svgcleankit.pages.dev</a>), privacy is not an afterthought or a policy toggle — it is the fundamental architectural constraint of the software.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            When you drag and drop an SVG file, browse your local drive, or paste raw SVG markup into our tool, <strong>your files are never uploaded to our servers, stored in any database, or transmitted across the internet</strong>. All parsing, minification, path calculation, and ZIP packaging are performed locally within your browser sandbox using client-side WebAssembly and JavaScript engines.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="rounded-[12px] border border-[var(--color-hairline)] bg-[var(--color-canvas-elevated)] p-6 sm:p-8">
          <h2 class="font-sans text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]">
            2. Information We Do Not Collect
          </h2>
          <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
            <li><strong>Vector graphics and assets:</strong> We have zero access to your SVG code, artwork, logos, illustrations, or coordinates.</li>
            <li><strong>Personal identifying information:</strong> We do not require accounts, logins, email addresses, passwords, or registration.</li>
            <li><strong>Third-party tracker cookies:</strong> We do not utilize intrusive advertising pixels, marketing trackers, or behavior profiling networks.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="rounded-[12px] border border-[var(--color-hairline)] bg-[var(--color-canvas-elevated)] p-6 sm:p-8">
          <h2 class="font-sans text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]">
            3. Local Browser Storage
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            The only data saved to your browser's local storage (<code class="font-mono text-xs bg-[var(--color-hairline-soft)] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] text-[var(--color-ink)]">localStorage</code>) is your visual theme preference (<code class="font-mono text-xs bg-[var(--color-hairline-soft)] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] text-[var(--color-ink)]">'light'</code> or <code class="font-mono text-xs bg-[var(--color-hairline-soft)] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] text-[var(--color-ink)]">'dark'</code>). This setting stays strictly on your device to remember your interface preferences between visits.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="rounded-[12px] border border-[var(--color-hairline)] bg-[var(--color-canvas-elevated)] p-6 sm:p-8">
          <h2 class="font-sans text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]">
            4. Offline Capability
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Because SVG Clean Kit is built as a static application, you can load the website, disconnect your device from the internet (e.g., Airplane mode), and continue optimizing sensitive vector graphics with complete peace of mind.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="rounded-[12px] border border-[var(--color-hairline)] bg-[var(--color-canvas-elevated)] p-6 sm:p-8">
          <h2 class="font-sans text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]">
            5. Contact Information
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            If you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy or vector privacy in general, please visit our <a href="/contact" class="text-[var(--color-link)] underline">Contact Page</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 pt-6 border-t border-[var(--color-hairline)] flex justify-between items-center text-xs">
        <a href="/" class="text-[var(--color-ink)] font-medium hover:underline">&larr; Back to Optimizer</a>
        <a href="/terms" class="text-[var(--color-body)] hover:text-[var(--color-ink)]">Read Terms of Service &rarr;</a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
